trustd(8)                   System Manager's Manual                  trustd(8)

NAME
     trustd – Daemon and LaunchAgent that performs trust evaluations

SYNOPSIS
     trustd

DESCRIPTION
     trustd provides services for evaluating trust in certificates for all
     processes on the system.

     This command is not intended to be invoked directly.

